  "thag1.62:0.3": "",
  "thag1.62:0.4": "1. 7. 2. ",
  "thag1.62:1.1": "ekakā mayaṃ araññe viharāma ",
  "thag1.62:1.2": "apaviddhaṃ va vanasmiṃ dārukaṃ ",
  "thag1.62:1.3": "tassa me bahukā pihayanti ",
  "thag1.62:1.4": "nerayikā viya saggagāminanti. itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ",
  "thag1.62:1.5": "vajjiputto thero gāthaṃ abhāsitthā’ti. vajjiputtattheragāthā. "
}
